# Weekly Write — IDE fallback

If `data/weekly-write-ide-brief.md` exists (awaiting IDE), or the user asks to draft/notify a weekly Write:

1. Open `docs/essay-voice.md` (shared human bar, including the title pass and the hiring-manager story).
2. Follow the project skill **`weekly-write-essay`** (`.cursor/skills/weekly-write-essay/SKILL.md`).
3. Notify Slack; do **not** publish MDX yourself — Approve in `#career-ops`.

For showcase / rewrite / Related-response essays (no weekly brief), use the router `.cursor/rules/orbit-essays.mdc` → personal skill **`orbit-essay`**.
